 "checks": "Assists summed per player from Transfermarkt club pages and compared with ESPN's 2025/26 assists leaders. Assist counting differs between providers: the same ten names are the top ten on ESPN, but some totals differ by one to three (shown as \"x or y\"). Lamine Yamal is first on both (12 and 11). Below him the order differs between the two (Rashford is 2nd on Transfermarkt with 10 but has 7 on ESPN), so places 2 to 10 are one pool: the nine names in the ESPN top ten after Yamal, plus Brahim Diaz, who ties for 9th on Transfermarkt with 8 (ESPN 6). Any of the ten fills a place. Figures (Transfermarkt, ESPN): Lamine Yamal 12, 11; Marcus Rashford 10, 7; Nicolas Pepe 10, 8; Luis Milla 10, 10; Pedri 9, 9; Fermin Lopez 9, 9; Arda Guler 9, 9; Abde Ezzalzouli 9, 8; Dani Olmo 8, 8; Federico Valverde 8, 8; Brahim Diaz 8, 6."
